{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "123ec8758a8a7d7ff42f93548a30e3b0fcc228624404d60a4bdbb170ada0e922", "ja": "（39プロジェクトのオーディションは\n順調に進んでいる。さて、次の子は……）", "zh": "（39PROJECT的成员甄选进行得十分顺利。\n下一位是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f466b71d34da4966809377c4fd509c9410591a3be0f64718034817fcad99de8e", "ja": "（中谷育……まだ10歳か。一体、どんな子だろう？）", "zh": "（中谷育……才十岁啊。会是什么样的孩子呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "1f1be23f689d496539fc408ae19d7ecf43880cfc97b37b3635ebd47736d7af62", "ja": "はじめまして、中谷育です！\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "初次见面，我叫中谷育！\n请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_1003_p", "source_sha256": "136c5d0f5aa6bf206f0ee451c1ae4447f3384a2b213e3531695adb2f7021ae5d", "ja": "初めまして。元気な挨拶だね。", "zh": "你好，打招呼时很有活力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "9dbc5d82a7f8f3f5204cfc147d5b6c10c04070eec1082c13d7c772761c9a905d", "ja": "あいさつは、お仕事の基本なんだって。\nおかあさんがいつも言ってます！", "zh": "因为妈妈平常老是说\n打招呼是工作的基本！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "acfd0377a5a633ebb46cfa8071103ee19c4bb30d39e74684833f47a623767610", "ja": "明るく元気にハキハキとって、\n教えてもらいました！", "zh": "妈妈叮咛我要开朗有活力，\n处事伶俐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f63a4a1deba1fbc8eb8719526aa6c7bd463ab89963daa84456b5c99fc027c49d", "ja": "はは、敬語もしっかりしてるなぁ。\nでも、俺には普通に話してくれていいよ。", "zh": "哈哈，你的遣词用字也很客套呢。\n但用普通的方式跟我说话就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "23212734a85f802d5335e8375c68a8152e5ed8ca68787790be4a36d25f2da501", "ja": "そう……なんですか？\nでも大人は、みんな敬語をつかうって……。", "zh": "是……这样吗？\n可是听说大人们讲话时都很客套……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_1008_p", "source_sha256": "97fd6167e1593caac312ad321291d97122ae8d9173e010a9d2dad2cf67dec586", "ja": "大人でも、仕事仲間なら普通に話すんだ。\n対等な関係だからね。", "zh": "就算是大人，面对工作伙伴时也是用普通方式讲话喔。\n因为是对等的关系啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "71794a58507650a759c6fba82f52da47e94cbcff1384c165870bfb85511528ca", "ja": "そうなんだ！　わかりました……\nじゃなくて、わかった！", "zh": "这样啊！明白……\n不对，我知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "21dcc1fed1f98b1ca6471ac02a69d2add0ebad07621e9d669b3d93d575d3c136", "ja": "じゃあわたしのことも、育って呼んでね！\n育ちゃんって、子どもっぽいもん。", "zh": "那你也要叫我育喔！\n因为叫育妹妹很小孩子气嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4cf430122e9076d1160f4f2692f44059a3418c75ccc3f125f97f3a8b8f9da15c", "ja": "ああ、わかった。それじゃ、育に質問だ。\nどうしてアイドルになりたいのかな？", "zh": "嗯，我知道了。那么我要来问育几个问题。\n为什么你会想当偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "8a9f08361d5c0daf0b8acf2b859bd447a2a0b674baf9ce191db0b4828a861015", "ja": "えっと……わたし、演技が上手なんだって。\nこの前、おかあさんにほめてもらったんだよ♪", "zh": "那个……听说我的演技好像不错，\n之前妈妈称赞过我喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "20acbe6de309c35c9bc924152bc41fa4650fb94bc958472e763a01cde85e8661", "ja": "それでね、「育には才能があるみたいだから、\nアイドルを目指してみたら」って言われたの！", "zh": "然后啊，妈妈还说「看来育似乎有才华，\n要不要试着以偶像为目标」！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_1014_p", "source_sha256": "bf88fefd1f3ccef24e91381e50bf853f1b915f735b314eb2728b374c92ba12ac", "ja": "へぇ、そうなのか。\n演技は、習い事かなにかかな？", "zh": "是喔，原来如此。\n你的演技是去学的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "b6052a8559b2f6f129a3e072af5de70de18c7cd8a6ba87c3aeda249bfe219be1", "ja": "うん！　あとお絵かきとか、体操のスクールとか……。\n学校から帰ったら、毎日いろんなところに通ってるよ。", "zh": "嗯！我还有学画图跟体操之类的……\n每天放学后都会去各种才艺班上课。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e8e6b788b00445a92298551f8824a0089636139d4313668801cc34e49bafa4dd", "ja": "毎日！？\nそんなに習い事をしてたら大変じゃないか？", "zh": "每天！？\n学那么多东西不会很累吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "b055677a20c11c00ec1425dec2309613c1dfdc2b2b2738fb86f0f2587bce333c", "ja": "ぜんぜん！　へっちゃらだよ！\nいそがしくてちょっと大変だけど、どれも楽しいもん。", "zh": "完全不会！没问题的！\n虽然很忙有点辛苦，但每件事做起来都很开心嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "5ae15f6a37ed46e277a1859e31aef14c70863c26bfa9bbfbdae08633e77fa606", "ja": "賞がもらえるとみんなほめてくれるし、\n本当にすごく楽しい！", "zh": "要是得了奖还会被大家称赞，\n真的很开心喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_1019_p", "source_sha256": "cf07f4d30e0f154f2811ab9f6ba1aa4d537b57ce2618e8dbe28b3607a804d4e5", "ja": "（この歳で様々な習い事をやりながら、しっかり結果を\n出せるなんて……こんな子、なかなかいないぞ！）", "zh": "（这个年纪就在学各种才艺，\n还能拿到好成果……这种孩子很少见喔！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_1020", "source_sha256": "7f8354a6527db909d196ec480e15d6a619dba6369e42758706f5d9526ae4c968", "ja": "合格！", "zh": "录取！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "1b8d43f7fe177100a21a8b153ceba7b65fb8907f59cb2bcb6ead2e4ee1143c23", "ja": "育。君さえよかったら、\n俺と一緒にトップアイドルを目指してみないか？", "zh": "育，如果你愿意的话，\n要不要和我一起以顶尖偶像为目标努力呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_2001_030iku", "source_sha256": "fe6a54bab2b10188de0afe66054f1c721b91124b6aec35ba286c2b2660321d49", "ja": "えっ！？　いいの？　本当に？", "zh": "什么！？可以吗？真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_2002_p", "source_sha256": "0bd23888af8b76c4bbafbb2c29c7e5c3e6decb34277305a3a407a34ad78133b7", "ja": "ああ。\n育にはきっと、アイドルになる才能があると思うんだ。", "zh": "嗯。\n我想育一定有当偶像的才华。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_2003_030iku", "source_sha256": "67aedd37a5de3489b41219e5982259ef2745c650faa4bcbeb3d83c9f8dd1fbea", "ja": "うん！　わたし、アイドルやりたい！　なる！", "zh": "嗯！我想当偶像！我要当！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_2004_p", "source_sha256": "081c279e66bed0cceeefb607a323002c4b29d04a8bd7e7cd520bb7a746742598", "ja": "よかった！　それじゃあ改めて、\n俺が君のプロデューサーだ！　一緒に頑張ろうな！", "zh": "太好了！那我再重新自我介绍一下，\n我是你的制作人！我们一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_2005_030iku", "source_sha256": "089115547267ca33e79aa156efc6c0a13b1534b70d83f41c9916c258c1b3a516", "ja": "はい！\n{$P$}さん、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "好的！\n{$P$}先生，请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_001_2006_p", "source_sha256": "262e677171d532a8ab15c88eb34d9be45b3faec8a9b44bb0a1e86cfaf097d3f9", "ja": "（何事にも前のめりな姿勢と、この笑顔……。\nきっとこの子をトップアイドルにしてみせるぞ！）", "zh": "（对任何事都很积极的态度，还有这张笑容……\n我一定会让这孩子当上顶尖偶像的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
